    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can move in sudden, swaying ways, gaining the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Leap to Your Feet.</strong> When you have the Prone condition, you can stand up by spending 5 feet of movement.</p><p><strong>Redirect Attack.</strong> When an enemy misses you with a melee attack roll, you can take a Reaction and spend 1 Focus Point to make that attack hit one creature of your choice, other than the attacker, that you can see within 5 feet of you.</p>",
